WEBVTT

01:37.670 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.120 --> 01:43.700
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.700 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 6]

02:43.660 --> 02:46.540
[Murder Warning by the Black Chest]

02:55.120 --> 02:56.680
For many years, Northern Kun

02:56.680 --> 02:58.520
has had constant friction
with our dynasty.

02:58.520 --> 03:00.180
Years ago, they marched south

03:00.400 --> 03:01.400
and confronted Prince Ping's border army

03:01.400 --> 03:02.840
for months.

03:03.120 --> 03:04.590
The delegation came this time

03:04.590 --> 03:05.960
in the name of exchanging credentials

03:05.960 --> 03:07.080
to seek a truce.

03:07.190 --> 03:08.840
In fact, they intend to

03:08.840 --> 03:10.570
spy on our dynasty's strength.

03:10.710 --> 03:11.710
I propose

03:11.860 --> 03:13.310
that we should let Wenbu

03:13.360 --> 03:15.120
see our army's ceremonial drill

03:15.120 --> 03:16.850
to show our national prestige.

03:16.960 --> 03:17.910
Meanwhile,

03:18.020 --> 03:22.160
[The Eldest Prince of the Shi Empire,
Prince Ding Zhou Miao]

03:18.150 --> 03:20.870
tell Prince Ping
to stand ready at the border

03:21.120 --> 03:23.320
to prevent Northern Kun from invading.

03:25.360 --> 03:26.160
Your Majesty,

03:26.230 --> 03:27.140
I think

03:27.190 --> 03:28.680
there's no need for such trouble.

03:28.680 --> 03:30.410
In dealing with such barbarians,

03:30.410 --> 03:31.270
there's no need to be polite.

03:31.270 --> 03:32.590
Just detain Wenbu,

03:32.620 --> 03:34.350
and they won't dare to send troops rashly.

03:34.350 --> 03:36.950
The border crisis
will naturally be resolved.

03:37.360 --> 03:39.590
Miao, you must understand that

03:40.000 --> 03:42.430
Wenbu is the Crown Prince of Northern Kun.

03:42.520 --> 03:43.750
A Crown Prince

03:44.270 --> 03:46.000
is the foundation of a country.

03:46.310 --> 03:47.630
He's the key.

03:47.910 --> 03:48.870
He is not someone

03:49.680 --> 03:51.960
that a low-born illegitimate prince

03:51.960 --> 03:52.960
or any random nobody

03:52.960 --> 03:54.310
can compare to.

03:59.710 --> 04:01.000
As far as I know,

04:01.190 --> 04:01.960
this Wenbu

04:01.960 --> 04:03.960
has been traveling through our Great Shi,

04:03.960 --> 04:06.890
indulging in wine and women
and acting shamelessly.

04:07.500 --> 04:09.820
Such a coward

04:10.130 --> 04:11.960
may have the title of Crown Prince,

04:11.960 --> 04:13.030
but he only relies on

04:13.030 --> 04:15.190
his mother being the legitimate wife.

04:15.210 --> 04:17.040
In fact, he is good for nothing.

04:17.750 --> 04:18.600
In my opinion,

04:19.310 --> 04:21.040
the Khan of Northern Kun may not,

04:21.040 --> 04:22.950
for this useless son,

04:23.070 --> 04:25.600
give up his grand ambition.

04:28.750 --> 04:29.360
Miao—

04:29.360 --> 04:30.600
The Crown Prince said

04:31.750 --> 04:32.950
to detain Wenbu.

04:33.600 --> 04:34.870
The First Prince said

04:35.720 --> 04:38.320
we should prepare for war
to show our prestige.

04:43.750 --> 04:44.950
Grand Secretary Bai,

04:45.950 --> 04:47.720
what do you have to say?

04:48.290 --> 04:50.409
[Bai Qi, Senior Grand Secretary]

04:54.750 --> 04:55.560
That year,

04:56.310 --> 04:58.360
I followed the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi

04:58.360 --> 04:59.560
to attack Liluo.

04:59.750 --> 05:00.920
Sleeping in the mountains,

05:00.920 --> 05:02.270
I suddenly heard wolves howling

05:02.270 --> 05:03.750
outside the tent at night.

05:04.310 --> 05:05.950
I was very scared,

05:06.390 --> 05:08.870
but I didn't dare to go out
and see what was going on.

05:08.870 --> 05:10.800
The sound got closer and closer,

05:10.800 --> 05:11.920
closer and closer,

05:11.920 --> 05:14.270
and I got more and more scared.

05:14.600 --> 05:16.460
Until that thing came to the tent,

05:16.800 --> 05:18.190
I suddenly remembered

05:18.310 --> 05:19.440
that inside my tent,

05:19.560 --> 05:22.560
there were still
over a dozen armored soldiers standing.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.760
Grand Secretary Bai,

05:24.070 --> 05:25.070
what does this

05:25.600 --> 05:28.060
have to do with
the Northern Kun delegation?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.390
What I mean is,

05:29.560 --> 05:31.120
when others are in our territory,

05:31.120 --> 05:33.920
they should be the ones
facing a formidable enemy,

05:33.950 --> 05:35.480
not us.

05:38.120 --> 05:39.320
Grand Secretary Bai,

05:39.750 --> 05:42.270
are you done with the story?

05:43.000 --> 05:44.040
Later we found out

05:44.070 --> 05:45.130
it wasn't a jackal,

05:45.190 --> 05:46.600
just a wild dog,

05:46.600 --> 05:48.200
and a very well-behaved one.

05:49.560 --> 05:50.360
Good.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.560
If it's a dog,

05:53.159 --> 05:54.830
we treat it with courtesy.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.040
If it's a jackal,

05:56.190 --> 05:58.360
we have soldiers too.

05:58.720 --> 06:00.190
Let's wait and see.

06:00.430 --> 06:01.240
Good.

06:02.270 --> 06:04.310
Send word to the Northern Kun delegation.

06:04.310 --> 06:05.840
They've had a hard journey.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.600
Let them rest at the Envoy Residence.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.260
Treat them with state honors.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.430
Do not neglect them.

06:11.950 --> 06:13.970
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

06:13.970 --> 06:16.070
[Envoy Residence]

06:14.720 --> 06:16.560
The Divine Constable Bureau
will send elites

06:16.560 --> 06:18.070
to guard the Envoy Residence.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.620
[Envoy Residence]

06:18.560 --> 06:20.190
There must be no mistakes.

06:25.110 --> 06:28.960
[Envoy Residence]

06:29.680 --> 06:31.560
Your Highness, mind the steps.

06:32.040 --> 06:33.680
These are gifts from various officials

06:33.680 --> 06:35.680
to you.

06:38.750 --> 06:40.600
This is an ancient jade fossil,

06:40.600 --> 06:42.000
extremely rare and precious.

06:42.000 --> 06:42.560
Look,

06:42.560 --> 06:43.750
there are so many

06:43.750 --> 06:44.950
rare treasures here.

06:50.170 --> 06:51.050
What is this?

06:51.270 --> 06:52.159
Strange.

06:52.190 --> 06:54.390
This black chest isn't on the gift list.

07:43.720 --> 07:45.190
Your Highness, are you alright?

07:45.190 --> 07:46.320
You call this a gift?

07:46.800 --> 07:48.270
Such an ominous object.

07:48.720 --> 07:50.240
This is clearly a curse,

07:50.350 --> 07:52.159
a provocation to Northern Kun!

07:52.360 --> 07:53.600
Please calm down, My Lord!

07:53.600 --> 07:54.630
I really didn't know!

07:54.630 --> 07:55.830
This item is not on the Ministry of Rites

07:55.830 --> 07:56.720
gift list!

07:56.720 --> 07:57.490
How dare you!

07:57.950 --> 07:58.920
Your Highness!

07:59.190 --> 07:59.950
Stop!

08:10.720 --> 08:12.630
Prince Wenbu, please behave yourself.

08:12.630 --> 08:13.830
Inside Tianhuang City,

08:13.830 --> 08:14.920
you cannot draw weapons so easily.

08:14.920 --> 08:16.920
The Divine Constable Bureau again.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.750
Do you people
from the Divine Constable Bureau

08:18.750 --> 08:20.680
enjoy going against me?

08:44.000 --> 08:45.510
Please let Lord Zhang go.

08:45.910 --> 08:47.150
The Divine Constable Bureau

08:47.150 --> 08:49.480
will definitely give you an explanation.

08:52.150 --> 08:53.120
Your Highness,

08:53.600 --> 08:55.730
this is Great Shi territory after all.

08:56.150 --> 08:58.790
Why not give them a chance?

08:59.150 --> 09:00.630
If they can't find out,

09:01.000 --> 09:02.800
it won't be too late for us to act.

09:08.360 --> 09:09.150
Fine.

09:09.720 --> 09:11.270
I'll give you a deadline.

09:12.390 --> 09:13.790
If the time passes

09:13.790 --> 09:14.840
and you still haven't found out,

09:14.840 --> 09:17.030
don't blame me for taking action.

09:17.790 --> 09:20.200
One day is enough.

09:20.840 --> 09:22.100
What are you thinking?

09:23.000 --> 09:23.910
I

09:24.120 --> 09:27.750
will only give you the time of one dance.

09:28.590 --> 09:30.070
Come, play the music!

09:30.480 --> 09:31.760
Dance!

10:18.940 --> 10:25.060
[Clear as a Mirror]

10:22.320 --> 10:25.360
Work carefully, all of you!

10:39.200 --> 10:40.630
Especially the new guy!

10:41.320 --> 10:42.510
Work hard!

10:42.630 --> 10:43.670
Don't slack off!

11:18.720 --> 11:20.080
Wipe that clean

11:20.150 --> 11:21.000
and put it up.

11:23.600 --> 11:24.360
Mr. Qi.

11:24.600 --> 11:25.360
Mr. Li.

11:25.870 --> 11:26.670
I see

11:27.240 --> 11:29.240
these weapons are very unique.

11:29.240 --> 11:30.030
I wonder

11:30.910 --> 11:32.110
what their origin is.

11:32.720 --> 11:34.320
That's a long story.

11:34.630 --> 11:35.600
These are all

11:35.600 --> 11:37.330
the weapons of the past Chiefs.

11:37.600 --> 11:38.720
This Zhanjieyu

11:38.720 --> 11:39.670
is the sword of the first Chief,

11:39.670 --> 11:40.910
Ling Wufeng.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.810
That Fufengqie is even more impressive.

11:46.960 --> 11:48.550
The second Chief, Chu Xuanji,

11:47.700 --> 11:49.930
[Chu Xuanji, Second Chief] [Fufengqie]

11:48.790 --> 11:51.550
held this sword to intimidate all evil.

11:55.670 --> 11:56.440
Our Divine Constable Bureau

11:56.440 --> 11:57.790
is indeed mighty.

11:57.910 --> 11:58.870
Isn't it?

12:13.910 --> 12:15.000
This Chief Constable's Hall

12:15.000 --> 12:17.360
is the office of the past Chiefs.

12:18.150 --> 12:21.360
It's surrounded by the patterns
of the nine sons of the dragon.

12:21.360 --> 12:23.000
This bronze statue
of the Bi'an divine beast

12:23.000 --> 12:25.120
crawls on the dome right in the middle,

12:25.120 --> 12:27.320
symbolizing the strictness of the law.

12:29.030 --> 12:30.150
I see.

12:33.270 --> 12:34.080
Mr. Qi.

12:35.960 --> 12:38.240
After we finish cleaning this hall

12:38.240 --> 12:39.550
later,

12:40.360 --> 12:41.150
can we

12:41.150 --> 12:42.880
go clean the Tianshu Pavilion?

12:45.510 --> 12:47.120
What kind of place
is the Tianshu Pavilion?

12:47.120 --> 12:48.510
Not even dust can fly in.

12:48.510 --> 12:50.240
Do you think it needs cleaning?

12:50.360 --> 12:51.790
Not even dust can fly in?

12:52.120 --> 12:53.670
How did that person get in?

12:54.000 --> 12:55.400
He is a Divine Constable.

12:57.790 --> 12:59.190
He just took out his token

13:02.790 --> 13:03.630
and went in.

13:08.910 --> 13:09.720
Then...

13:10.200 --> 13:12.330
how can one become a Divine Constable?

13:12.630 --> 13:14.840
You are a trainee constable now.

13:15.150 --> 13:16.910
If you endure for 3 years
without making mistakes,

13:16.910 --> 13:18.080
you can be promoted.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.480
Three years?

13:20.790 --> 13:21.600
After 3 years,

13:21.600 --> 13:23.000
you will be a third-class constable,

13:23.000 --> 13:23.790
just like me.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.440
You won't have to clean
the latrine anymore,

13:25.440 --> 13:26.840
but can be a porter

13:26.960 --> 13:28.750
and participate in some simple cases.

13:28.750 --> 13:29.630
Another 5 years,

13:29.630 --> 13:30.360
and you can become

13:30.360 --> 13:31.630
a second-class constable.

13:31.630 --> 13:32.840
But after becoming
a second-class constable,

13:32.840 --> 13:34.150
you can't just bide your time.

13:34.150 --> 13:36.440
You have to accumulate
merits and solve cases.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.910
Becoming a first-class constable

13:37.910 --> 13:39.000
depends on luck.

13:39.000 --> 13:40.550
Generally speaking,
in the Divine Constable Bureau,

13:40.550 --> 13:41.790
constables with more than 20 years
of experience

13:41.790 --> 13:42.990
are all first-class.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.120
Head Constable Yao
is a first-class constable.

13:50.120 --> 13:51.240
It's just that he's old now.

13:51.240 --> 13:52.200
His legs are not good,

13:52.200 --> 13:53.730
and he can't go to the scene.

14:02.910 --> 14:03.720
Mr. Qi.

14:04.150 --> 14:06.010
Above the first-class constable

14:06.120 --> 14:07.200
is the Divine Constable, right?

14:07.200 --> 14:08.000
No.

14:08.440 --> 14:09.720
Above the first-class constable

14:09.720 --> 14:10.750
is the third-class head constable,

14:10.750 --> 14:11.630
then the second-class head constable,

14:11.630 --> 14:12.720
then the first-class head constable,

14:12.720 --> 14:13.440
and then the chief head constable.

14:13.440 --> 14:14.150
Stop.

14:16.790 --> 14:17.850
Then let me ask you.

14:18.360 --> 14:20.750
Ms. Bai, Mr. Meng,

14:20.790 --> 14:21.790
and Lord Lou—

14:21.790 --> 14:22.790
why are they Divine Constables

14:22.790 --> 14:24.000
at such a young age?

14:24.510 --> 14:25.390
That's because

14:25.390 --> 14:28.990
the Divine Constables
have all solved earth-shattering cases.

14:29.000 --> 14:30.460
Earth-shattering cases?

15:44.600 --> 15:45.510
Your Highness!

15:45.840 --> 15:46.870
What should we do?

15:56.030 --> 15:56.430
[Benevolence and Neighborly Amity]

16:05.000 --> 16:06.270
What's this whistle for?

16:06.270 --> 16:08.510
It's the order
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

16:08.510 --> 16:09.440
It means that

16:09.510 --> 16:10.960
no matter what case we are handling

16:10.960 --> 16:11.910
and what stage it is at,

16:11.910 --> 16:13.120
we must stop temporarily

16:13.120 --> 16:14.780
and gather at the crime scene.

16:14.910 --> 16:15.960
That is to say,

16:16.480 --> 16:18.120
just like nature calls,

16:18.660 --> 16:20.030
no matter how busy we are,

16:20.030 --> 16:21.360
we have to put it on hold.

16:21.370 --> 16:24.030
This is the earth-shattering case
I mentioned.

16:34.320 --> 16:36.510
We want to see the Emperor of Great Shi

16:36.960 --> 16:38.420
to ask for an explanation.

16:39.320 --> 16:40.120
Step aside!

16:40.150 --> 16:41.100
-Step aside!
-Step aside!

16:41.100 --> 16:42.560
-Step aside!
-Step aside!

16:49.830 --> 16:51.560
-Head Constable Yan.
-Mr. Yan.

16:51.910 --> 16:54.320
The Divine Constable Bureau
has been established for 46 years.

16:54.320 --> 16:57.150
Among all the major cases

16:57.200 --> 16:58.000
and murder cases in Tianhuang City,

16:58.000 --> 17:00.000
is there any that we couldn't solve?

17:00.030 --> 17:01.840
-No! No!
-No! No!

17:02.870 --> 17:05.200
But if someone takes
the opportunity to cause trouble,

17:05.069 --> 17:07.900
[Yan Cheng, Constable Iron]

17:05.440 --> 17:08.270
can the Divine Constable Bureau
let outsiders

17:08.680 --> 17:10.540
disturb the peace of the capital?

17:10.720 --> 17:12.670
-No! No!
-No! No!

17:16.349 --> 17:17.839
You heard it.

17:18.480 --> 17:21.270
We will solve the murder case.

17:21.829 --> 17:22.680
You

17:23.310 --> 17:25.380
must stay in the Envoy Residence.

17:26.680 --> 17:28.310
You make it sound nice.

17:29.510 --> 17:30.910
Prince Wenbu was

17:30.930 --> 17:32.620
under the protection
of the Divine Constable Bureau

17:32.620 --> 17:33.680
when he was killed.

17:33.790 --> 17:35.720
How can I trust you?

17:36.710 --> 17:39.170
How can I trust
the Divine Constable Bureau?

18:00.310 --> 18:01.000
Yan,

18:01.000 --> 18:01.790
are you okay?

18:02.400 --> 18:03.200
I'm fine.

18:07.550 --> 18:08.550
It's you again.

18:09.960 --> 18:12.350
Yes, it's me again.

18:14.920 --> 18:15.720
Mr. Yan,

18:15.790 --> 18:16.920
didn't you go back to your hometown
to visit your relatives?

18:16.920 --> 18:18.250
Why are you back so soon?

18:18.830 --> 18:19.550
As soon as I heard

18:19.550 --> 18:22.000
the news that the Northern Kun delegation
entered the capital,

18:22.000 --> 18:23.350
I rushed back.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.480
You're new here?

18:26.400 --> 18:27.720
You're quite bold.

18:29.790 --> 18:31.070
I've always been bold.

18:31.070 --> 18:32.200
Trainee Constable!

18:34.510 --> 18:35.310
Step back.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.000
Yes.

18:37.830 --> 18:39.090
Divine Constable Lou.

18:39.790 --> 18:41.400
The men of Northern Kun

18:41.880 --> 18:43.270
only die in battle;

18:43.680 --> 18:44.940
they never fear death.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.350
I came here this time

18:47.750 --> 18:49.680
to bring His Majesty's oral edict.

18:49.720 --> 18:50.850
Listen to the edict!

18:53.830 --> 18:55.350
An oral decree from His Majesty:

18:55.350 --> 18:56.480
From this moment on,

18:56.590 --> 18:58.400
the nine gates
of Tianhuang City are closed.

18:58.240 --> 19:00.930
[Tianhuang City]

19:00.510 --> 19:01.440
Scholars, farmers, artisans, merchants,

19:00.950 --> 19:02.050
[Proclamation]

19:01.510 --> 19:03.070
peddlers, and all other people,

19:02.070 --> 19:03.560
[Divine Constable Tally]

19:03.200 --> 19:05.200
as well as officials below the third rank,

19:05.200 --> 19:07.030
shall not enter or leave without an edict.

19:07.030 --> 19:09.240
The Divine Constable Bureau is ordered

19:09.350 --> 19:11.350
to bring the murderer
to justice within 7 days.

19:11.350 --> 19:13.720
The Grand Secretariat
and the Ministry of Justice officials

19:13.720 --> 19:16.030
must cooperate with the bureau
to hunt down the murderer.

19:16.030 --> 19:17.240
No disobedience is allowed.

19:17.240 --> 19:17.900
-Yes!
-Yes!

19:17.920 --> 19:18.710
-Yes!
-Yes!

19:18.730 --> 19:19.530
-Yes!
-Yes!

19:28.720 --> 19:29.510
Mr. Yan,

19:30.150 --> 19:32.070
the Emperor's word is unbreakable.

19:32.070 --> 19:33.720
His Majesty will definitely
give Northern Kun

19:33.720 --> 19:35.590
and Prince Wenbu justice.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.030
Lord Yan.

19:49.510 --> 19:51.220
[Envoy Residence]

19:56.600 --> 19:57.240
That's hard to say.

19:57.240 --> 19:58.000
I don't know.

19:58.350 --> 19:59.070
Something happened

19:59.070 --> 20:00.240
right in this room.

20:00.240 --> 20:02.000
-Really?
-Who is so bold?

20:02.200 --> 20:02.960
Prince Wenbu

20:02.960 --> 20:05.200
was murdered under the protection
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

20:05.200 --> 20:06.440
Since the establishment
of the Divine Constable Bureau

20:06.440 --> 20:07.480
46 years ago,

20:06.680 --> 20:09.280
[Divine Constable Bureau]

20:07.480 --> 20:08.400
there has never been

20:08.400 --> 20:10.000
such an appalling incident.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.290
Normally speaking,

20:12.480 --> 20:14.240
the Envoy Residence is heavily guarded.

20:14.240 --> 20:14.920
Not even a bird

20:14.920 --> 20:16.070
could fly in,

20:16.480 --> 20:18.540
let alone a stranger going in and out.

20:39.030 --> 20:41.100
The gifts for foreign guests
should logically

20:41.100 --> 20:42.960
go through layers of inspection.

20:43.140 --> 20:44.950
How could the black chest

20:44.980 --> 20:47.110
appear out of thin air among the gifts?

20:47.200 --> 20:48.600
What's even stranger is,

20:48.760 --> 20:49.590
the chest seems to have

20:49.590 --> 20:50.790
foreseen the future,

20:50.790 --> 20:51.880
predicting the scene of

20:51.880 --> 20:53.110
Prince Wenbu's murder,

20:53.110 --> 20:55.110
with every detail exactly the same.

20:56.920 --> 20:58.400
Given the condition of the corpse,

20:58.400 --> 20:59.160
even Ms. Bai

20:59.160 --> 21:00.310
has never seen it before,

21:00.310 --> 21:01.880
let alone examined it.

21:07.070 --> 21:08.270
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao.

21:08.680 --> 21:09.810
Go in and take a look.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.640
My Lord!

21:23.640 --> 21:24.400
What are you doing?

21:24.400 --> 21:25.480
Let me in!

21:25.480 --> 21:26.440
What kind of place do you think this is?

21:26.440 --> 21:27.970
My cousin is still inside!

21:28.000 --> 21:28.960
Young man.

21:29.070 --> 21:30.680
-Step back! Step back!
-Please let me in,

21:30.680 --> 21:32.200
-okay?
-Back off! Back off!

21:32.200 --> 21:33.400
Constable Eagle, Lord Lou,

21:33.400 --> 21:35.000
asked me to wait for you here.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.350
Lord Lou?

21:37.310 --> 21:38.920
You're just an unregistered runner.

21:38.920 --> 21:40.380
Why are you waiting for me?

21:41.110 --> 21:42.030
Young man,

21:42.480 --> 21:43.550
do you know how I

21:43.550 --> 21:45.030
got into the Divine Constable Bureau?

21:45.030 --> 21:46.230
Step back! Step back!

21:46.640 --> 21:47.600
Because

21:47.680 --> 21:49.510
I have good handwriting.

21:50.310 --> 21:52.920
The so-called sweeping armies with a pen

21:53.110 --> 21:54.770
and writing with iron strokes

21:54.920 --> 21:56.240
refer to me.

21:56.920 --> 21:59.030
So at this scene,

21:59.200 --> 22:01.130
any copying and transcribing work

22:01.200 --> 22:02.680
is my responsibility.

22:04.920 --> 22:06.050
Then come in with me.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.200
Alright.

22:15.270 --> 22:18.160
Sorting and classifying may seem boring,

22:18.910 --> 22:21.220
but it actually cultivates the mind

22:21.310 --> 22:22.680
and trains the eyes.

22:24.920 --> 22:26.590
I can also practice my handwriting.

22:26.590 --> 22:27.680
Isn't it wonderful?

22:27.480 --> 22:30.280
[Class A‑2, Gem & Tribute Gifts]

22:30.300 --> 22:30.650
[Class A‑2, Gem & Tribute Gifts]
[Class C‑1, Gem & Tribute Gifts]

22:30.920 --> 22:31.680
Friend.

22:32.640 --> 22:33.570
Watch your step.

22:36.560 --> 22:37.460
Be careful.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.160
I think if I keep this up

22:49.200 --> 22:50.510
for 100 years,

22:51.000 --> 22:53.260
I can become the fifth Divine Constable.

22:53.310 --> 22:54.070
Lord Yan.

22:56.920 --> 22:57.830
Lord Yan.

23:03.640 --> 23:04.440
Yan.

23:05.030 --> 23:05.830
Your hand...

23:06.400 --> 23:07.200
I'm fine.

23:07.480 --> 23:08.270
How is it?

23:10.310 --> 23:11.110
The corpse...

23:11.680 --> 23:13.280
Corpse fluid is hard to test.

23:13.510 --> 23:15.000
But judging from the smell,

23:15.000 --> 23:16.510
it's the poison called Yama's Call—

23:16.510 --> 23:17.640
"Yama wants you dead at midnight;

23:17.640 --> 23:18.590
who dares keep you until dawn?"—

23:18.590 --> 23:20.920
or the Seven-Step
Corpse-Dissolving Powder.

23:20.920 --> 23:21.720
This thing

23:21.920 --> 23:23.380
must be hard to get, right?

23:24.640 --> 23:26.310
Not only are the ingredients
extremely rare,

23:26.310 --> 23:27.790
but the refining process

23:27.790 --> 23:28.720
is extremely dangerous.

23:28.720 --> 23:29.400
One careless mistake,

23:29.400 --> 23:30.920
and you might dissolve yourself.

23:30.920 --> 23:31.590
It's said that

23:31.590 --> 23:33.070
among the masters who refine Yama's Call,

23:33.070 --> 23:35.070
9 out of 10 have missing fingers

23:35.070 --> 23:36.350
or are blind.

23:38.200 --> 23:39.510
That makes it easy.

23:40.310 --> 23:41.710
We'll ask them one by one.

23:41.920 --> 23:43.720
Interrogate all the black market
medicine sellers,

23:43.720 --> 23:44.830
and we'll know

23:44.920 --> 23:46.680
who the buyer is.

23:46.830 --> 23:48.510
Leave this to me.

23:48.920 --> 23:50.310
A few lashes of the whip,

23:50.310 --> 23:51.510
and they'll confess everything.

23:51.510 --> 23:52.310
No need.

23:52.790 --> 23:53.830
As far as I know,

23:54.000 --> 23:54.790
in this Tianhuang City,

23:54.790 --> 23:56.240
the only bottle of Yama's Call

23:56.240 --> 23:58.480
is in the coroner's room
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.440
In your room.

24:00.070 --> 24:01.350
That's impossible.

24:01.830 --> 24:02.880
Our Divine Constable Bureau

24:02.880 --> 24:04.340
is already a den of tigers.

24:04.880 --> 24:05.920
Your room

24:06.680 --> 24:08.080
is even more terrifying.

24:10.000 --> 24:10.960
Why is he here?

24:13.340 --> 24:14.400
After all, he was personally recruited

24:14.400 --> 24:15.680
by the Chief.

24:15.680 --> 24:17.140
We have to look out for him.

24:17.510 --> 24:19.200
Since there are no clues elsewhere,

24:19.200 --> 24:21.240
we should start by interrogating people.

24:21.240 --> 24:23.070
The last ones to approach Prince Wenbu

24:23.070 --> 24:24.400
should be a few dancers.

24:24.680 --> 24:27.280
Meng has already
started interrogating them.

24:30.550 --> 24:31.350
Where is he?

24:34.590 --> 24:35.680
So unlucky.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.270
I was hoping the prince

24:37.270 --> 24:38.790
would give some reward money,

24:38.790 --> 24:40.550
but now there's nothing.

24:52.240 --> 24:54.100
You were supposed to be off today.

24:54.200 --> 24:55.270
Why did you switch days

24:55.270 --> 24:56.330
with Miss Chuntao?

24:57.000 --> 24:57.790
I...

24:59.750 --> 25:00.550
I...

25:01.030 --> 25:02.590
I admire Prince Wenbu of Northern Kun's

25:02.590 --> 25:03.590
peerless beauty,

25:03.680 --> 25:04.880
and wanted to see him.

25:07.590 --> 25:09.250
I'll give you one more chance.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.550
Say it again.

25:12.510 --> 25:14.570
My brother owes money from gambling,

25:14.640 --> 25:16.030
and my family is short of money.

25:16.030 --> 25:17.030
So I thought

25:17.030 --> 25:18.920
if I could get Prince Wenbu's
appreciation,

25:18.920 --> 25:20.580
I might get more reward money.

25:24.310 --> 25:25.070
Leave.

25:33.480 --> 25:34.270
Miss.

25:38.310 --> 25:39.110
Miss.

25:39.510 --> 25:40.960
As a lady,

25:41.000 --> 25:42.310
even if you're angry,

25:42.310 --> 25:43.720
you should smile more.

25:43.920 --> 25:44.680
Because

25:45.310 --> 25:46.640
ladies who love to smile

25:46.680 --> 25:48.310
usually don't have bad luck.

25:48.510 --> 25:49.720
What is he doing now?

26:01.510 --> 26:02.480
Mr. Li.

26:03.030 --> 26:05.000
Taking advantage of the investigation
to flirt with women.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.160
How carefree.

26:07.680 --> 26:09.140
Ms. Bai, you are mistaken.

26:09.790 --> 26:11.320
I am taking advantage of...

26:13.310 --> 26:15.240
the opportunity to sort things out

26:15.590 --> 26:16.990
to investigate the case.

26:24.160 --> 26:24.960
Miss.

26:26.920 --> 26:29.310
Why do you look so familiar?

26:32.590 --> 26:33.400
Have we

26:34.270 --> 26:35.310
met somewhere

26:35.310 --> 26:36.160
before?

26:47.480 --> 26:48.270
Zhenzhu.

26:49.510 --> 26:52.310
If this Corpse-Dissolving Powder
is used on a person,

26:52.310 --> 26:54.370
how long at most
will it take to take effect?

26:54.370 --> 26:55.400
At most the duration of a dance.

26:55.400 --> 26:56.160
Otherwise, how could it have

26:56.160 --> 26:57.490
the name "Yama's Call"?

26:59.510 --> 27:00.720
Before Wenbu died,

27:00.790 --> 27:02.390
he happened to watch a dance.

27:02.920 --> 27:03.960
Based on the time,

27:04.270 --> 27:05.550
the murderer should have

27:05.550 --> 27:07.610
poisoned him in the Envoy Residence.

27:07.750 --> 27:08.510
After the poison took effect,

27:08.510 --> 27:10.640
the scene was sealed off,
and no one entered or left.

27:10.640 --> 27:11.700
So the murderer...

27:15.880 --> 27:17.160
must still be here.

27:18.310 --> 27:19.770
Are the dancers suspects?

27:21.200 --> 27:22.440
That's why I said,

27:22.480 --> 27:23.310
"Leave it to me."

27:23.310 --> 27:24.880
A good whipping for each of them,

27:24.880 --> 27:27.410
and they'll definitely confess everything.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.440
Little Goldfish.

27:40.310 --> 27:41.840
I told you I recognized you.

27:41.920 --> 27:43.320
I didn't lie to you, did I?

27:45.480 --> 27:46.830
Then do you remember me?

27:47.400 --> 27:48.640
Young Master Qingyang.

27:48.640 --> 27:50.400
You often come with the Crown Prince.

27:50.400 --> 27:51.720
Of course, I remember.

27:52.400 --> 27:53.920
Young Master Qingyang, do you remember me?

27:53.920 --> 27:55.200
Do you remember me, Young Master Qingyang?

27:55.200 --> 27:56.920
-Do you remember me?
-Do you remember me?

27:56.920 --> 27:57.720
Look.

27:58.920 --> 28:00.030
What is this?

28:00.540 --> 28:01.580
Silver!

28:01.610 --> 28:03.060
-Silver!
-Silver!

28:04.030 --> 28:05.350
Okay, let me show you.

28:06.510 --> 28:07.570
I want it. I want it.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.510
I want it.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.030
Silver.

28:20.310 --> 28:21.110
Okay.

28:22.720 --> 28:23.880
Don't rush.

28:23.880 --> 28:25.480
I'll ask you some questions.

28:25.720 --> 28:27.110
If you answer well,

28:27.510 --> 28:30.310
there will naturally
be no shortage of reward silver.

28:30.310 --> 28:31.720
-Thank you, Young Master Qingyang.
-Thank you, Young Master Qingyang.

28:31.720 --> 28:32.580
Ask us quickly.

28:33.070 --> 28:33.960
Let me ask you.

28:35.000 --> 28:37.110
Both kind words and silver

28:37.110 --> 28:38.640
can achieve the goal.

28:39.830 --> 28:41.110
But why are some people

28:41.510 --> 28:43.170
always willing to use swords?

28:49.480 --> 28:53.610
-Young Master, we'll take our leave.
-Young Master, we'll take our leave.

28:55.510 --> 28:56.310
Miss,

28:56.640 --> 28:58.240
you have quite a few calluses

28:58.310 --> 28:59.310
on your hand.

29:03.310 --> 29:04.840
What are you doing, My Lord?

29:05.240 --> 29:06.030
Sorry.

29:07.310 --> 29:08.110
My apology.

29:09.680 --> 29:11.030
Mr. Meng, your mind is now

29:11.030 --> 29:12.070
full of the case.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.440
I guess

29:13.920 --> 29:14.750
you thought

29:14.750 --> 29:16.270
this lady's calluses

29:16.440 --> 29:17.640
were on her thumb web.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.880
You suspected she was an assassin

29:19.880 --> 29:22.340
who has been wielding
swords for a long time.

29:22.720 --> 29:24.510
But this lady's calluses

29:24.880 --> 29:26.140
are on her fingertips.

29:26.920 --> 29:29.780
This is caused by doing manual labor
for a long time.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.070
Mr. Meng.

29:36.240 --> 29:38.070
I have frequented brothels
for a long time,

29:38.070 --> 29:40.130
often buying some unfortunate women

29:40.200 --> 29:41.640
into the Star-Gathering Pavilion

29:41.640 --> 29:42.970
to help them start anew.

29:44.590 --> 29:45.400
So,

29:47.790 --> 29:49.920
I know these ladies better than you do.

29:50.240 --> 29:51.920
As for interrogating the dancers,

29:51.920 --> 29:53.310
why not leave it to me?

30:07.510 --> 30:08.350
It seems

30:09.030 --> 30:10.830
we are both unfortunate people.

30:11.590 --> 30:13.640
Young Master Qingyang,
you're the richest in the world.

30:13.640 --> 30:15.240
How can you be like me?

30:20.310 --> 30:21.240
Then why don't we

30:21.720 --> 30:23.640
have a good talk about

30:24.110 --> 30:25.070
what it means to

30:25.720 --> 30:28.680
meet by chance without prior acquaintance?

30:43.480 --> 30:46.480
I wonder what advice you have,
Young Master Qingyang.

30:49.210 --> 30:50.450
I also want to ask you

30:53.310 --> 30:55.270
why you killed Prince Wenbu.

30:56.600 --> 30:58.950
W-What are you talking about?

31:00.000 --> 31:01.880
Prince Wenbu had expert guards,

31:02.310 --> 31:03.920
and I don't know how to fight.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.350
How could I kill him?

31:07.640 --> 31:08.440
True.

31:09.070 --> 31:10.920
You indeed don't know martial arts,

31:10.920 --> 31:12.920
and you don't have calluses on your hands

31:12.920 --> 31:14.920
from holding a sword for a long time.

31:16.480 --> 31:17.310
But...

31:20.480 --> 31:21.510
your fingers

31:22.070 --> 31:23.480
are still rough

31:24.000 --> 31:25.260
and peeling severely.

31:25.510 --> 31:26.200
This is because

31:26.200 --> 31:28.240
people who develop poisons for a long time

31:28.240 --> 31:29.920
inevitably get poison on their hands

31:29.920 --> 31:31.880
and need to wash them frequently.

31:36.720 --> 31:37.510
I guess

31:38.240 --> 31:40.100
you are an expert in using poison.

31:42.310 --> 31:43.110
Not long ago,

31:43.790 --> 31:46.070
I came to the Envoy Residence
with the Crown Prince.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.720
I admired your zither skills

31:48.110 --> 31:51.310
and wanted to invite you
to the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

31:51.480 --> 31:52.270
I offered a price

31:52.270 --> 31:54.160
that no one could refuse.

31:54.720 --> 31:55.720
But you

31:58.510 --> 31:59.720
refused.

32:01.030 --> 32:01.830
So,

32:02.590 --> 32:04.450
you stayed at the Envoy Residence

32:04.720 --> 32:05.880
because there must be something

32:05.880 --> 32:07.510
you have to do, right?

32:17.880 --> 32:20.340
I didn't expect that
my long-planned scheme

32:23.680 --> 32:25.960
was exposed by a playboy.

32:27.270 --> 32:28.880
It's truly a trick of fate.

32:30.640 --> 32:32.770
Young Master Qingyang, you're right.

32:33.930 --> 32:35.710
I do have some knowledge

32:36.150 --> 32:37.550
of toxicology.

32:57.400 --> 32:58.300
Oh no.

33:14.920 --> 33:16.450
What is the meaning of this?

33:19.510 --> 33:21.710
I was afraid your sword would be too fast

33:21.830 --> 33:23.310
and kill the suspect.

33:23.720 --> 33:25.780
When the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

33:25.880 --> 33:27.030
someone must die.

33:27.240 --> 33:28.240
Not necessarily.

33:31.270 --> 33:32.830
Aren't you an exception?

33:38.750 --> 33:39.550
Let's go.

33:49.110 --> 33:51.070
My Lords, it's time to eat.

33:56.510 --> 33:58.310
Yan, any results yet?

33:58.680 --> 34:00.070
Before we even used torture,

34:00.070 --> 34:01.600
she confessed everything.

34:05.830 --> 34:07.830
This woman has a tragic background.

34:08.190 --> 34:09.480
Her father and brothers
all died tragically

34:09.480 --> 34:11.110
under the iron hooves of Northern Kun.

34:11.110 --> 34:12.440
So last year,

34:12.440 --> 34:14.320
she sneaked in here as a dancer,

34:14.320 --> 34:15.800
waiting for a chance to seek revenge.

34:15.800 --> 34:16.860
But unexpectedly,

34:17.190 --> 34:18.790
before she could make a move,

34:19.070 --> 34:21.030
Prince Wenbu had died.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.320
That's all.

34:23.920 --> 34:24.960
In that case,

34:25.110 --> 34:26.800
detain her in the Divine Constable Bureau

34:26.800 --> 34:28.510
for attempted murder pending trial.

34:28.510 --> 34:29.320
-Yes.
-Yes.

34:35.230 --> 34:37.290
Sometimes I really don't understand

34:37.670 --> 34:40.630
which is more important,

34:41.320 --> 34:42.980
revenge or living a good life.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.070
Don't judge others

34:49.230 --> 34:51.290
unless you've walked in their shoes.

35:12.320 --> 35:13.320
Where is Mr. Meng?

35:14.230 --> 35:15.230
Who knows?

35:15.280 --> 35:16.230
That ice block

35:16.230 --> 35:17.360
is always so aloof.

35:18.710 --> 35:20.440
The scene investigation and interrogation

35:20.440 --> 35:21.630
yielded nothing.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.510
We questioned all suspects,

35:23.510 --> 35:24.710
but made no progress.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.760
Right after Wenbu died,

35:26.760 --> 35:27.320
our people

35:27.320 --> 35:28.440
locked down the scene.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.920
Everyone and everything was checked.

35:29.920 --> 35:31.800
Not even a piece of paper
could be thrown out.

35:31.800 --> 35:32.960
But we couldn't find any clues

35:32.960 --> 35:34.320
on anyone.

35:35.110 --> 35:37.040
Could it be that we're looking
in the wrong direction,

35:37.040 --> 35:38.370
and the murderer

35:38.390 --> 35:39.850
is actually from without?

35:40.590 --> 35:41.400
Impossible.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.230
Why are you so sure?

35:46.710 --> 35:47.970
Because of the timing.

35:50.440 --> 35:51.360
My Lords,

35:51.800 --> 35:52.710
think about it.

35:53.320 --> 35:55.980
The Corpse-Dissolving Powder
is highly toxic.

35:56.110 --> 35:56.960
If

35:57.230 --> 35:58.110
Wenbu had been poisoned

35:58.110 --> 35:59.480
outside,

35:59.710 --> 36:01.280
he would have died

36:01.480 --> 36:03.810
before the dancers even started dancing.

36:15.190 --> 36:16.030
Ms. Bai,

36:17.000 --> 36:18.510
your noodles have been sitting for so long

36:18.510 --> 36:19.770
and have gotten soggy.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.010
Are they still good?

36:22.670 --> 36:24.280
Young Master Qingyang,
you're used to fine dining,

36:24.280 --> 36:26.940
so naturally, you can't stand
this coarse food.

36:30.670 --> 36:31.480
I mean,

36:31.920 --> 36:34.440
noodles get soggy if left for too long.

36:51.710 --> 36:52.880
It's really possible that Wenbu

36:52.880 --> 36:54.280
took the poison outside.

37:00.480 --> 37:02.210
Noodles get soggy when soaked,

37:02.230 --> 37:03.360
and paper wrapped in the stomach
for a long time

37:03.360 --> 37:04.490
will also dissolve.

37:04.590 --> 37:06.070
As long as the murderer
used a medicinal film

37:06.070 --> 37:08.030
or paper to wrap the powder,

37:08.110 --> 37:09.480
let Wenbu swallow it,

37:09.710 --> 37:10.510
and then...

37:20.280 --> 37:21.230
This way,

37:21.230 --> 37:22.480
if the timing was calculated well,

37:22.480 --> 37:24.070
even if Wenbu took the poison

37:24.070 --> 37:25.190
before coming to the Envoy Residence,

37:25.190 --> 37:27.120
he could last until after the dance

37:27.280 --> 37:30.080
when the powder finally
dissolved in his stomach.

37:33.280 --> 37:34.070
So,

37:34.670 --> 37:36.960
the murderer is indeed from without.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.880
Still not right.

37:56.000 --> 37:56.760
If the murderer

37:56.760 --> 37:59.320
wanted to create
the effect of a murder warning,

37:59.320 --> 38:01.070
he must have calculated exactly

38:01.070 --> 38:03.510
when Wenbu took the poison
and when it would act,

38:03.510 --> 38:05.070
without any error.

38:06.320 --> 38:08.640
If the murderer was outside,

38:08.670 --> 38:09.880
there's no way

38:09.880 --> 38:11.880
he could calculate it so precisely.

38:12.000 --> 38:14.510
So is the murderer outside

38:14.880 --> 38:16.280
or inside?

38:24.630 --> 38:26.630
There's another suspicious point.

38:26.880 --> 38:28.080
Generally speaking,

38:28.400 --> 38:29.530
destroying a corpse

38:29.760 --> 38:30.510
is to prevent people

38:30.510 --> 38:31.960
from finding it.

38:32.230 --> 38:32.960
But the murderer

38:32.960 --> 38:34.440
has already murdered someone

38:34.440 --> 38:35.360
in plain sight.

38:35.800 --> 38:36.880
Then why

38:37.710 --> 38:39.150
dissolve the corpse?

38:40.710 --> 38:42.880
Is it purely to scare people?

38:46.280 --> 38:47.070
Also,

38:48.110 --> 38:50.640
since the murderer
is so precise with poison,

38:51.320 --> 38:52.110
any poison

38:52.110 --> 38:53.320
would do.

38:53.630 --> 38:55.110
Why must he choose

38:55.110 --> 38:56.280
such an expensive

38:56.320 --> 38:58.190
and easily traceable

38:58.190 --> 38:59.790
Corpse-Dissolving Powder?

39:01.920 --> 39:03.960
Not bad, newbie.

39:04.280 --> 39:05.840
Your analysis makes sense.

39:08.840 --> 39:12.360
-Lord Constable Iron, I'm...
-Then what, in your view, is the cause?
